      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TWIGSTAR (2) has been impressive in winning her three starts so far. Came to this circuit for the first time at her latest appearance and led from a couple of spots wider before scoring comfortably by 12 metres. Has the speed take advantage of this favourable starting position so gets her chance to maintain the unbeaten record but a trio of runners form the Emma Stewart yard are all potential dangers. Her Art Major filly SPOOKY MOTH (1) is at the track for the first time but looked above average in winning her latest trial and the ace draw will help her. FARADY (6) draws widest and will need better manners after breaking last time but showed ability in wining here on debut.",
